WEBVTT

00:08.600 --> 00:13.973
Your humble servant pays respects to Your Majesty today, let's not follow the ruler-subject formalities.

00:14.840 --> 00:18.413
I came to see you just want to talk about family matters.

00:19.880 --> 00:21.080
Yes.

00:21.160 --> 00:22.560
Your Maj-.

00:24.880 --> 00:27.520
Brother-in-law come, sit.

00:32.840 --> 00:38.600
I know these years you've been depressed because of Ruolan.

00:38.880 --> 00:43.800
I often think back to when Ruolan was still here Your Majesty if you have any matters.

00:43.880 --> 00:46.200
Just directly order me to do them.

